d scenario check_in_dates step 6 shows a successful 201 check-in. The same route refuses archived habits (409 habit_archived), bad dates (422), and a second check-in on the same date (409 already_checked_in). Other users' habits answer 404, and an anonymous caller gets 401.\",\"citations\":[{\"target\":\"cell:ann|POST /v1/habits/{}/completions\",\"step\":null,\"quote\":\"201\"},{\"target\":\"scenario:check_in_dates\",\"step\":6,\"quote\":\"POST /v1/habits/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000100/completions as ann -> 201\"},{\"target\":\"rule:R72\",\"step\":null,\"quote\":\"answers 201 `{id, habit_id, date, note, created_at, updated_at}`\"},{\"target\":\"scenario:check_ins_on_an_archived_habit_are_refused\",\"step\":1,\"quote\":\"POST /v1/habits/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000100/completions as ann -> 409\"},{\"target\":\"scenario:second_check_in_on_a_date_is_refused\",\"step\":2,\"quote\":\"POST /v1/habits/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000100/completions as ann -> 409\"},{\"target\":\"cell:no token|POST /v1/habits/{}/completions\",\"step\":null,\"quote\":\"401\"},{\"target\":\"cell:ben|POST /v1/habits/{}/completions\",\"step\":null,\"quote\":\"404\"},{\"target\":\"impl:route:POST /v1/habits/{}/completions\",\"step\":null,\"quote\":\"implemented_unverified\"}],\"implementation\":\"implemented_unverified\",\"implementation_basis\":\"static\"}","ttft_ms":4544,"type":"result","duration_ms":8408,"uuid":"c8e2f909-43e5-431a-b7d4-482f81a23c03","ttft_stream_ms":1874,"time_to_request_ms":17,"first_content_frame_ms":1874,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
